@* 指标卡里的迷你图：Stat 的子内容占满数值下面的一行；折线看走势、面积看总量的起伏、柱看每月的多少。
   读屏念成一句话（几个值、从哪到哪、最低最高），Label 写在前面 *@
@inherits RuneComponent

<Grid MinItemWidth="@("14em")" Balanced="true" Gap="SpaceScale.Md">
    <Card>
        <Stat Label="实际销售" Value="360" Unit="万元" Change="0.333m" ChangeLabel="较上月">
            <Sparkline Data="savings" Label="近 12 个月实际销售" ValueFormat="Wan" />
        </Stat>
    </Card>
    <Card>
        <Stat Label="门户访问" Value="1680" Unit="次" Change="0.127m" ChangeLabel="较上月">
            <Sparkline Data="visits" Type="SparklineType.Area" Tone="Tone.Info" Label="近 12 个月门户访问" />
        </Stat>
    </Card>
    <Card>
        <Stat Label="超时任务" Value="1" Unit="项" Tone="TextTone.Danger" Change="-0.667m" InvertChange="true">
            <Sparkline Data="overdue" Type="SparklineType.Bar" Tone="Tone.Danger" Label="近 12 个月超时任务" />
        </Stat>
    </Card>
</Grid>

@code {
    static readonly NumberFormat Wan = new() { Suffix = "万元" };
    static readonly decimal?[] savings = [40, 70, 150, 205, 180, 150, 185, 150, 190, 205, 270, 360];
    static readonly decimal?[] visits = [820, 932, 901, 934, 1290, 1330, 1320, 1180, 1420, 1510, 1490, 1680];
    static readonly decimal?[] overdue = [6, 4, 7, 3, 2, 5, 1, 0, 2, 1, 3, 1];
}
